{
  "//": [
    "The UI files that type-check under `strict`: tsconfig.ui.json's options with strict on.",
    "`npm run check:types:ui` runs it after tsconfig.ui.json. A file joins `include` once it checks",
    "clean here. The PRONI app and words.js joined on 8 Nov 2026 (the noImplicitAny review, S5c);",
    "browse.js joined on 12 Nov 2026 (stream rf8-types), when tsconfig.ui.json itself turned strict on: this list now names",
    "every file of tsconfig.ui.json, and a file stays in it even if that config is ever loosened.",
    "The Elections app (site/apps/elections/, its /pkg/ re-exports under site/pkg/) joined on 11 Nov 2026 (arch audit P0/P5)."
  ],
  "extends": "./tsconfig.ui.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "strict": true
  },
  "include": [
    "../site/browse/browse.js",
    "../packages/ui/assets/state/machine.js",
    "../packages/ui/assets/state/theme.js",
    "../site/browse/state-machines.js",
    "../site/apps/proni-search/state-machines.js",
    "../packages/ui/src/templates/proni/record-view.js",
    "../site/apps/words/state-machines.js",
    "../packages/ui/assets/gallery/gallery.js",
    "../site/apps/proni-search/app.js",
    "../site/apps/words/words.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/app.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/gallery-specimens.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/config.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/embed/embed.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/api.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/charts.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/count.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/duck.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/format.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/lifecycle.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/limits.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/maplibre.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/party.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/pivot.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/project.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/route.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/lib/scales.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/state-machines.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/views/compare.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/views/contest.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/views/election.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/views/home.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/views/map.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/views/notional.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/views/pivot.js",
    "../site/apps/elections/views/swing.js",
    "../site/assets/i18n/i18n.js"
  ]
}
